OL,3,GNEWSAFormer councillor nominated for
OL,4,Acivic honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former councillor, described as
OL,7,Fhaving made an "enormous contribution
OL,8,Fto public life", has been nominated to
OL,9,Freceive one of the local authority's
OL,10,Fhighest civic honours.
OL,12,FSunderland City Council's cabinet
OL,13,Frecommended Harry Trueman be appointed
OL,14,Fan Honorary Alderman of the City of
OL,15,FSunderland, following more than 30
OL,16,Fyears of serving his community.
OL,18,FThe position of Honorary Alderman is
OL,19,Fawarded to former councillors who have
OL,20,Fprovided distinguished service to the
OL,21,Flocal authority and the city.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
