OL,3,GNEWSAFormer councillor nominated for
OL,4,Acivic honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrueman said he was grateful for the
OL,7,Fnomination, adding: "Serving the people
OL,8,Fof Sunderland has been a privilege".
